---
import FinalFrontierLayout from "../layouts/FinalFrontierLayout.astro";
---
<FinalFrontierLayout title="Submit a Claim — Mythadis">
  <section class="route-heading">
    <span class="hero-kicker">SEND IT TO THE LAB</span>
    <h1>SEEN A<br /><em>SUSPICIOUS CLAIM?</em></h1>
    <p>Big promises. Convenient demonstrations. Results that sound too good to be true. We are interested in internet claims that can be tested.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="editorial-band">
    <div class="editorial-copy">
      <h2>WHAT MAKES A GOOD CLAIM?</h2>
      <p>A specific promise with an identifiable source and a result we can attempt to reproduce.</p>
      <ul><li>The original link or claim capture.</li><li>What is being promised and how it is supposed to work.</li><li>Any conditions, costs or limitations disclosed by the source.</li></ul>
      <p>Please avoid sharing private information. A public claim and its context are the starting point.</p>
    </div>
    <aside class="submission-panel">
      <div class="globe" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <h2>SUBMIT A CLAIM.</h2>
      <p>The submission mechanism is coming soon. This preview does not accept or store submissions.</p>
      <button class="submit-btn" disabled type="button">SUBMISSIONS COMING SOON</button>
    </aside>
  </section>
</FinalFrontierLayout>
